      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt feel temporary though. like i'm just waiting for the rest of me to catch up to the fact that i'm not really here. i go through the motions, i work, i eat, but it feels so fake. it's exhausting trying to pretend there's a person inside this skin when it feels like there's just a hollow space where i used to be.",
